2d7c001dbaa07242803484bbae05c4d5  /tmp/agent
5521a35b8d13f0206ed8586b36bba8c0  /tmp/agentshell
MD5CHK
~ # /tmp/agentshell
agentshell: this console belongs to the agent now.
  type a shell command, or: hermes-agent "your task in quotes"
  scheduled jobs and heartbeat checks fire on their own.
  type: exit (plain shell)  sh (interactive shell, exit returns)
